# Scope control for the graphify knowledge graph (graphify-out/).
# gitignore syntax. See graphify-out/README.md.

# Vendored third-party sources. GoogleTest, gMock and yaml-cpp test suites are
# pure test scaffolding for a dependency, and in the first build they dominated
# roughly a third of the largest communities, crowding out Chrono itself.
src/chrono_thirdparty/

# Bullet is vendored under the Chrono tree rather than chrono_thirdparty/.
# It is third-party in origin, and its cbtGjkEpa/cbtGImpact internals crowded out
# Chrono's own ChCollision* wrapper layer, so it is excluded too.
src/chrono/collision/bullet/

# Note: data/ is NOT excluded here. Its 564 vehicle specification JSONs are real
# Chrono::Vehicle content. Its prose assets and 337 textures are skipped at
# extraction time instead, since images cost one extraction pass each.
